Adventure Works has an OpenAPI 3.0 description of its ticketing API in a JSON file that begins like this:<pre>{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": { "title": "Tickets", "version": "1.0" },
  "servers": [ { "url": "https://api.adventure-works.example" } ]
}</pre>The team wants the agent to call the API through a REST API tool (Preview) without building a custom connector first. What should the maker do with the file?
